 <h3><u>Aap kya jaane Fatema kya hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span data-ft={ tn:k} class=userContent>Syeda, Tahira, Abida, Zahida, Taiyaba, Raziya, Marziya, Adila,<br> <br> Sajida Hura Batool e O Zara x2<br> <br> Surah e Qadr ka yeh nara hai<br> <br> Ap kya janeey Fatima kya hai<br> <br> Jis ko Mukhtar e amr kehthay hain<br> <span class=text_exposed_show><br> Jis ki ratoon ko qadr kehthay hain<br> <br> Subho ko jis ki Fajar kehthay hain<br> <br> Shaam ko jis ki asr kehthay hain<br> <br> Har zamanay pay jis ka qabza hain<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2<br> <br> Qadr jis ko sada qaza nay kaha<br> <br> Syeda jis ko Murtaza nay kaha<br> <br> Apni maa jis ko Mustafa nay kaha<br> <br> Kanzay Maghfi jisay khuda nay kaha<br> <br> Jis ki chokhat pay kaba jhukta hain<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2<br> <br> Jis kay dar say ho hal ata ko ata<br> <br> Inaman ki aman ka hai gosha<br> <br> Kul kafa jis ko khud gawaha bana<br> <br> Fateha kar rahi hai jis ki sana<br> <br> Pura Quran hee qasida hai<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2<br> <br> Jis ki chadar ko asmaan kahiye<br> <br> Apnay bachon ka sahiban kahiye<br> <br> Isko alhumd ka nishaan kahiye<br> <br> Hushr kid hoop main amaan kahiye<br> <br> Kulay imaan ka jo musala hai<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2<br> <br> Jiska baba Rasool aashiq e rab<br> <br> Jiskay baitay Hassan Hussain laqab<br> <br> Yeh jahan main hain sab say acha nasab<br> <br> Jiska shohar Ali ameer e arab<br> <br> Surah e noor jiska shajrah hai<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2<br> <br> Yeh gharaana sakhi mila humko<br> <br> Isi ghar say Nabi mila humko<br> <br> Har wasi, har wali mila humko<br> <br> Aik wali kya, Ali mila humko<br> <br> Isi ghar say khuda bhi paya hai<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2<br> <br> Jiska aik baita hai Imam e Hassan<br> <br> Aik baita Hussain Shah e Zaman<br> <br> Ai, Abbas mislay qila shikan<br> <br> Jis nay seekha Ali say jang e ka fan<br> <br> Jis ka dariya pay ab bhi qabza hai<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2<br> <br> Ghazi bola mizaaj keher main hai<br> <br> Mera hum pala koun sheher main hai<br> <br> Pyaas ka sud e baab neher main hai<br> <br> Neher yeh Syeda ke neher main hai<br> <br> Meher yeh khud khuda nay rakha hai<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2<br> <br> Dar pay jo sar jhuka nahi karta<br> <br> Deen o Majid wo paa nahi sakta<br> <br> Har koyi dark o paa nahi sakta<br> <br> Aira ghaira to aa nahi sakta<br> <br> Malakul mawt aa kay rukta hai<br> <br> Ap kya janey Fatima kya hai x2</span></span></p> 
